  "summary": "In a retrospective diagnostic study of 279 patients, the Fungitell (1-->3)-beta-D-glucan assay had 77.8% sensitivity for invasive fungal infection, high specificity against blood donors, and especially high positivity in Pneumocystis jiroveci pneumonia."
