  "summary": "A retrospective cohort study of 60,587 deceased donors found that many ideal pediatric-quality kidneys are allocated to higher-priority adults, primarily multiorgan recipients, and revising the KDPI to exclude race and HCV will not substantially affect the proportion of ideal pediatric-quality kidneys offered to children."
}

